## 🚀 Start Using It NOW

### 1. Start the Server
```bash
cd /home/dominh/Desktop/Wchem
./start-server.sh
```

### 2. Open in Browser
**Backend Test Page:** http://localhost:8000/backend-test.html

This interactive test page lets you:
- ✅ Sign up / Sign in
- ✅ Browse 17 chemical compounds
